        "latex": "\\begin{array}{ll}T,T_{\\mathrm b}\\ [\\mathrm K]&\\text{ring, base temperature}\\\\[0.6em]R\\ [\\mathrm{K/W}]&\\text{thermal resistance}\\\\[0.6em]P_h,P_{\\mathrm{pk}}\\ [\\mathrm W]&\\text{heater, peak absorption}\\\\[0.6em]P_{\\mathrm{abs}}\\ [\\mathrm W]&\\text{absorbed optical power}\\\\[0.6em]\\gamma\\ [\\mathrm m]&\\text{resonance HWHM}\\\\[0.6em]G_{\\mathrm{sh}}\\ [\\mathrm{m/W}]&\\text{optical thermal tuning}\\\\[0.6em]s\\ [\\mathrm{m/K}]&\\text{constant tuning slope}\\\\[0.6em]\\lambda_0\\ [\\mathrm m]&\\text{resonance without optical heat}\\\\[0.6em]\\lambda_L,\\lambda_r\\ [\\mathrm m]&\\text{laser, hot resonance}\\end{array}"
